 "remarks": "PRIME SoNo LOCATION - Spacious 3BR / 2.5BA Tri-Level Townhouse with Private Deck & 2-Car Garage Live in the heart of vibrant South Norwalk, just steps from SoNo's restaurants, shopping, nightlife, entertainment and the Metro-North station. This bright and spacious three-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath tri-level townhouse offers an open, comfortable layout with plenty of room to live, work and entertain. The main living level features hardwood floors and an open floor plan flowing into the updated kitchen with a large center island, perfect for casual dining and entertaining. The second level offers two generously sized bedrooms and a full bath. The top floor is dedicated to a spacious primary suite, complete with ample closet space, a private primary bath and its own private outdoor deck with water views. A two-car attached garage provides direct interior access to the lower level, where you'll also find a washer/dryer and convenient half bath. An excellent opportunity to enjoy townhouse living while being right in the middle of everything SoNo has to offer. Walk to dining, shopping, entertainment, the waterfront and Metro-North for an easy commute. Bright. Spacious. Private outdoor space. Two-car garage. Outstanding SoNo location. Please note: Zillow rental applications are not accepted.",
